{"version":1,"content":"<p>全球網站廣泛使用的程式語言PHP存在嚴重安全漏洞，多國政府周三（21日）緊急關閉網站，避免被黑客乘虛而入。</p><p>PHP的開發團隊周三已緊急發布更新版本，修復軟體中潛藏多年、直到近期才藉由人工智慧（AI）技術發現的漏洞，呼籲所有用戶立即更新。</p><p>【一文睇什麼是PHP？</p><p>】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:00:36.459851+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:17:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.523518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:35.407193+00:00","content_hash":"2e1a63579a388e8625eb489b92511e63430a7f14f3cbdb2988da91c6edfecd9c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}